    "summary": "Spend 1 CP in the opposing player's [Shooting phase](vsdata:core-rule/shooting-phase), right after an enemy unit finishes shooting.\n\nPick a **WORLD EATERS RHINO** model of yours that was hit by at least 1 of that enemy unit's attacks and still has at least 1 wound left. A single **KHORNE BERZERKERS** unit embarked in it may make a **[disembark move](vsdata:core-rule/disembark-move)**, then a **[surge move](vsdata:core-rule/surge-move)** of no more than D6+2\".\n\nNo unit can be the target of this Stratagem and of [Unrelenting Advance](vsdata:ability/world-eaters.goretrack-onslaught.unrelenting-advance) in one phase.",
